BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poll Greeter Training - In Person
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T143000
UID:947ece1c58db0658a46a1856afbaefd6@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Untitled%20document%20%282%29_20260417144220458336.png
DESCRIPTION:Each election the Dems greet voters at each polling place. The
 se greeters are a warm welcome\, a source for well-founded and accurate in
 formation\, and a last "reality check" before a voter enters the actual po
 lling place. Would you like to be a Democratic Poll Greeter or Poll Watche
 r? Have you done it before but want to brush up on what it takes? Join our
  Poll Greeter Training! This session is in person. There is also a virtual
  training session. In person training is in downtown Lancaster.
